{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — practical, whole-life support in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Schedule a VIP Day or ask a question.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f5efe6; --muted:#7a6a58; --accent:#8a5a3b; --accent-2:#c08a5b; --card:#fff7f0; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --max-width:1100px; --radius:12px; --shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(86,64,48,0.12);
      font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,"Noto Sans",sans-serif;
      color:var(--muted);
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg) 0%,#efe6d9 100%);}
    header{backdrop-filter:blur(6px);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),rgba(255,255,255,0.4));border-bottom:1px solid rgba(120,100,80,0.06);}
    .nav{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-right:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:15px}
    .cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}

    main{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:36px auto;padding:0 20px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:26px;align-items:center;padding:34px;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg'),linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(200,170,150,0.06),transparent);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .hero-left h1{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:32px;color:#3e2f24}
    .hero p{margin:0 0 18px;line-height:1.45}
    .hero-actions{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .btn{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:none;cursor:pointer}
    .btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:white;font-weight:700}
    .btn-ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(120,100,80,0.12)}

    .card{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(120,90,60,0.06)}
    .contact-panel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .contact-item{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:28px}
    .benefit{padding:16px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),transparent);}

    .process{margin-top:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .step{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
    .step .num{background:var(--accent-2);color:white;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700}

    .faq{margin-top:22px}
    .faq-item{border-top:1px solid rgba(120,100,80,0.06);padding:12px 0}
    .ask{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}

    footer{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:40px auto 80px;padding:14px 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    /* reveal animation */
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity 600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1),transform 600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}

    /* modal */
    .modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(18,12,8,0.45);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}
    .modal{background:white;max-width:760px;width:100%;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(40,30,20,0.4)}
    .modal-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .modal-body{margin-top:12px}

    /* breathing circle */
    .breath-circle{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:999px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%, #ffd8c2, #f5a76c);margin:20px auto}

    /* accessibility */
    @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
      .reveal{transition:none;transform:none;opacity:1}
      .breath-circle{transition:none}
    }

    @media(max-width:880px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="nav">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">HM</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="small">Practical whole-person care in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary Navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html">Programs</a>
        <a href="conditions.html">Conditions</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="about.html">Team</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="cta">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-left">
        <h1>Connect with a practical, whole-life clinician</h1>
        <p>We blend modern evidence with lifestyle clarity — short, clear plans that fit work, family, and the life you actually live. Start with a focused conversation and leave with one clear next step.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <button class="btn btn-primary" id="bookButton">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="tryButton">Try a guided exercise</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="card contact-panel">
        <div style="font-weight:800">Get in touch</div>
        <div class="contact-item small">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
        <div class="contact-item small">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        <div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Prefer a quick call? Use the form below and select "Call me" under contact preference.</div>
        <form id="contactForm" style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px">
          <input name="name" required placeholder="Your name" aria-label="Name" style="padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(120,100,80,0.08)">
          <input name="email" required placeholder="Email" aria-label="Email" style="padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(120,100,80,0.08)">
          <select name="pref" style="padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(120,100,80,0.08)">
            <option>Message</option>
            <option>Call me</option>
            <option>Book a VIP Day</option>
          </select>
          <textarea name="message" rows="3" placeholder="A few lines about why you are reaching out" style="padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(120,100,80,0.08)"></textarea>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-end">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" id="clearForm">Clear</button>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send inquiry</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="grid reveal" id="socialProof">
      <div class="benefit card">
        <strong>Focused planning</strong>
        <p class="small">Short, prioritized steps you can actually test this week — not abstract goals.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit card">
        <strong>One-day VIP option</strong>
        <p class="small">A concentrated day to map a realistic plan and hand you a simple path forward.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit card">
        <strong>Remote & in-person</strong>
        <p class="small">Telehealth and clinic options for follow-up and deeper labs if needed.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="process reveal" id="process">
      <div class="step card">
        <div class="num">1</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Intro conversation</strong>
          <div class="small">A 20–30 minute call to scope needs and fit.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step card">
        <div class="num">2</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Diagnostic visit</strong>
          <div class="small">A focused 60–90 minute assessment and mini-plan.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step card">
        <div class="num">3</div>
        <div>
          <strong>VIP Day (optional)</strong>
          <div class="small">An intensive collaborative day to design a realistic, phased plan.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq reveal" id="faq">
      <div style="font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px">Common questions</div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="ask"><strong>Do you treat chronic conditions?</strong></div>
        <div class="small">We provide education, assessment, and coordinated management strategies. This is supportive care and not a promise of cure — we work alongside your existing providers when appropriate.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="ask"><strong>What should I bring to my first visit?</strong></div>
        <div class="small">A concise medication list, recent labs if available, and a short summary of your top concerns. We’ll help focus the visit so it’s efficient and actionable.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal" style="margin-top:22px" id="cta">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px">
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800">Ready to talk?</div>
          <div class="small">Book an intro or request a VIP Day — we’ll make time to map a reliable next step.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
          <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="btn btn-primary">Reserve a slot</a>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="tryButton2">Try exercise</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — helping busy adults design manageable habits in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      <div class="small">Questions? <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <!-- Modal: Guided exercise -->
  <div class="modal-backdrop" id="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal" role="document" aria-labelledby="modalTitle">
      <div class="modal-head">
        <div id="modalTitle">Guided exercise</div>
        <div><button id="closeModal" aria-label="Close">Close</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px">
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" data-mode="breath">Breathing</button>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" data-mode="journ">Journaling</button>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" data-mode="intent">Intention</button>
        </div>

        <div id="modeArea">
          <!-- breathing -->
          <div id="breath" style="display:none;text-align:center">
            <div class="breath-circle" id="breathCircle" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div style="font-weight:700" id="breathLabel">Ready</div>
            <div class="small">A gentle 3-phase rhythm: inhale — hold — exhale. Follow the circle.</div>
            <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px">
              <button class="btn btn-primary" id="startBreath">Start 2-minute</button>
              <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="stopBreath">Stop</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- journaling -->
          <div id="journ" style="display:none">
            <div style="font-weight:700">Two-minute journaling</div>
            <p class="small">Write freely for 2 minutes. Use the prompt if you like.</p>
            <div style="background:#fff;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(120,100,80,0.06)">
              <div class="small"><em id="journPrompt">What is one small action that would make this week easier?</em></div>
              <textarea id="journText" rows="6" style="width:100%;margin-top:8px;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid rgba(120,100,80,0.06)"></textarea>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
              <div class="small" id="journTimer">2:00</div>
              <div>
                <button class="btn btn-primary" id="startJourn">Start</button>
                <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="stopJourn">Stop</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- intention -->
          <div id="intent" style="display:none">
            <div style="font-weight:700">Set a short intention</div>
            <p class="small">Choose one concrete intention you can try today.</p>
            <input id="intentInput" placeholder="I will..." style="width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(120,100,80,0.06)">
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:8px">
              <button class="btn btn-primary" id="saveIntent">Save</button>
            </div>
            <div id="intentSaved" class="small" style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Navigation for CTA
    document.getElementById('bookButton').addEventListener('click',function(){
      location.href = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}';
    });
    // Modal logic
    const modal = document.getElementById('modal');
    const tryButtons = [document.getElementById('tryButton'),document.getElementById('tryButton2')];
    tryButtons.forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',openModal));
    document.getElementById('closeModal').addEventListener('click',closeModal);
    modal.addEventListener('click',function(e){ if(e.target===modal) closeModal(); });

    function openModal(){
      modal.style.display='flex';
      modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');
      // default mode
      selectMode('breath');
      // focus trap: focus first button
      modal.querySelector('button[data-mode]')?.focus();
    }
    function closeModal(){
      modal.style.display='none';
      modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');
      stopBreath(); stopJourn();
    }

    // Mode switching
    document.querySelectorAll('button[data-mode]').forEach(btn=>{
      btn.addEventListener('click',()=>selectMode(btn.dataset.mode));
    });
    function selectMode(m){
      ['breath','journ','intent'].forEach(id=>document.getElementById(id).style.display = (id===m? 'block':'none'));
    }

    // --- Breathing exercise ---
    let breathTimer = null;
    const circle = document.getElementById('breathCircle');
    const breathLabel = document.getElementById('breathLabel');
    const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce)').matches;

    document.getElementById('startBreath').addEventListener('click',startBreath);
    document.getElementById('stopBreath').addEventListener('click',stopBreath);

    function startBreath(){
      if(prefersReduced){ breathLabel.textContent='Breathing (reduced motion)'; return }
      stopBreath();
      let phase=0; // 0 inhale,1 hold,2 exhale
      const phases = [4000,4000,6000]; // ms inhale hold exhale
      breathLabel.textContent='Get ready';
      circle.style.transform='scale(1)';
      let cycleStart = Date.now();
      breathTimer = setInterval(()=>{
        phase = (phase+1)%3;
        const duration = phases[phase];
        if(phase===0){ breathLabel.textContent='Inhale'; circle.style.transition = 'transform 4s ease-in-out'; circle.style.transform='scale(1.25)'; }
        if(phase===1){ breathLabel.textContent='Hold'; circle.style.transition = 'transform 4s linear'; circle.style.transform='scale(1.2)'; }
        if(phase===2){ breathLabel.textContent='Exhale'; circle.style.transition = 'transform 6s ease-in-out'; circle.style.transform='scale(0.7)'; }
      }, 4000); // step every inhale length to start flow
      // initial trigger
      breathLabel.textContent='Inhale'; circle.style.transition = 'transform 4s ease-in-out'; circle.style.transform='scale(1.25)';
    }
    function stopBreath(){ if(breathTimer){ clearInterval(breathTimer); breathTimer=null; } breathLabel.textContent='Stopped'; circle.style.transition='transform 300ms'; circle.style.transform='scale(1)'; }

    // --- Journaling ---
    let journInterval=null, journRemaining=120;
    const journTimerEl = document.getElementById('journTimer');
    document.getElementById('startJourn').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      journRemaining=120; journTimerEl.textContent = formatTime(journRemaining);
      document.getElementById('journText').focus();
      journInterval = setInterval(()=>{ journRemaining--; journTimerEl.textContent = formatTime(journRemaining); if(journRemaining<=0) stopJourn(); },1000);
    });
    document.getElementById('stopJourn').addEventListener('click',stopJourn);
    function stopJourn(){ if(journInterval){ clearInterval(journInterval); journInterval=null; } journTimerEl.textContent='2:00'; }
    function formatTime(s){ const m = Math.floor(s/60); const sec = s%60; return m+':'+(sec<10?'0'+sec:sec); }

    // --- Intention ---
    document.getElementById('saveIntent').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const val = document.getElementById('intentInput').value.trim();
      const out = document.getElementById('intentSaved');
      if(!val){ out.textContent='Write a short, practical intention.'; out.style.color='crimson'; return }
      out.style.color='var(--muted)';
      out.textContent='Saved: "'+val+'" — try it now and check back in this evening.';
    });

    // Form clear and submit (no backend)
    document.getElementById('clearForm').addEventListener('click',()=>document.getElementById('contactForm').reset());
    document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit',function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      alert('Thanks — your message is noted. We typically reply within 2 business days.');
      this.reset();
    });

    // === Scroll reveal with prefers-reduced-motion support ===
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce)').matches;
      const els = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      if(prefersReduced){ els.forEach(el=>el.classList.add('visible')); return }
      const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{
        entries.forEach(entry=>{
          if(entry.isIntersecting){ entry.target.classList.add('visible'); io.unobserve(entry.target); }
        });
      },{threshold:0.15});
      els.forEach(el=>io.observe(el));
    })();

    // Keyboard: close modal on Esc
    window.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){ if(e.key === 'Escape'){ if(modal.style.display==='flex') closeModal(); } });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"}}
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and notes for holistic_medicine site (chunk 4)

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html — Contact & guided-exercise page with embedded JS and CSS.

What this page contains:
- A simple responsive header and navigation linking to other site pages (index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html, contact.html).
- Hero with contact panel and a short form (no backend). Placeholders left for the site-wide values: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.
- Sections: social proof (benefits), process, FAQ, CTA — each set with the reveal class for scroll-triggered reveal.
- A guided exercise modal (local JS only) with three modes:
  - Breathing: animated circle that expands/contracts with inhale/hold/exhale phases. Respects prefers-reduced-motion.
  - Journaling: a two-minute free-write timer and a prompt.
  - Intention setting: quick single-line intention with immediate confirmation.
- Accessibility considerations: modal can be closed with Escape, backdrop click, and has aria attributes. prefers-reduced-motion support disables animations and auto-reveals sections.

Behavior & implementation notes:
- Scroll-triggered reveal: implemented with IntersectionObserver; if the user has prefers-reduced-motion: reduce set, elements are shown immediately without animation.
- Guided exercise: entirely client-side. No audio files or external resources are used. The breathing animation uses CSS transforms and JS timers. The journaling timer counts down in-browser.
- Contact form: client-only; submission triggers a friendly alert and clears the form.

Customization & integration:
- Replace placeholders with real values via your templating or build pipeline.
- The hero background references assets/img/pattern.svg; ensure that unique SVG pattern file exists at that path in the final site.

Accessibility & safety notes:
- Exercises are brief, low-intensity, and meant for general relaxation/clarity. They are educational and supportive, not medical treatments. Avoid promising therapeutic outcomes from the exercises.
- The site content follows a supportive educational tone and avoids medical guarantees.

Deployment:
- Drop contact.html into your site root alongside the other pages listed above.
- Ensure assets/img/pattern.svg is provided locally; no external fonts or CDNs are required.

If you want, I can now:
- Produce the matching SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg for the earthy_warm layout.
- Create the remaining pages (index, services, conditions, approach, pricing, about, book) to complete the site bundle with the same voice and layout.
"}}
BUNDLE_END
